  "style": "TARGET THEME: Starlight observatory. Deep desaturated indigo walls with slender copper ribs, quiet starry twilight and far mountains through the same window opening, geometric clipped-corner window trim within original bounds. Furniture cool walnut, indigo panels, muted lavender-blue upholstery, warm ivory pages, brushed pale silver hardware. Refined restrained small pin accents on solid structural wood only, NEVER on blank dynamic covers/pages/screens. Cool starlight balanced with soft warm light. If scene contains plant, silver-green plant in a midnight ceramic pot at same location. No neon, no spaceship, no additional crystals, telescopes or ornaments.",
